---
source: tests/help_pages.rs
description: "a command's -h and --help pages as this build renders them at 100 columns without color; any change to an about, a flag, a value, a heading or the layout changes them: review with cargo insta review, or re-accept with INSTA_UPDATE=always cargo test --test integration help_pages:: and review git diff tests/snapshots/"
---
==> omaddons <==
World of Warcraft addon manager for Linux and an Omarchy widget

Usage: omaddons [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Look      status  list  outdated  info  search  errors  export  history  plans
          net-log  doctor
Change    install  update  pin  unpin  adopt  sync  copy  remove  undo  apply
          backup
Setup     targets  config  auth  omarchy  completions  robot-docs  capabilities
          help

Start with `omaddons status`. Run `omaddons help <command>` for details; add
--json for one JSON envelope on stdout.
Agents: omaddons capabilities --json · omaddons robot-docs guide
        omaddons doctor --json

Exit codes:
  0  ok            Success, including partial success (partial: true)
  1  failed        Runtime failure; see error.retryable
  2  usage         Unknown command or flag, bad argument, bad ref syntax
  3  not_found     Unknown or ambiguous target, ref, addon, plan or transaction
  4  refused       Safety refusal; fix names the flag or command
  5  locked        Lock held past the acquire timeout; retryable
  6  check_failed  An opt-in assertion (--check, --strict) failed
